'''Coup de Chat''' (キャットクーデター ''Kyattokūdetā'', '''Cat Coup d'État''') is the 10th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 59th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
All of the stages pose little to no challenge with the right strategy, as most of them rely on very specific gimmicks that are easy to overcome. The only stage with no real gimmick is [[Cricket Ideology]], an [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] remake with the enemies replaced by more advanced variants, but is still rather simple with a good enough generalist lineup. Overall, a more relaxing sub-chapter compared to the last few ones.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|100}}

